# Preset-local skill root. Intentionally empty until issue #7 migrates the
# canonical `suquo-systems-parametria` skill here.
#
# An empty or absent skill root discovers nothing (`listSkillRootEntries`
# returns `[]` on ENOENT/ENOTDIR), so the operator's existing
# `~/.agents/skills/suquo-systems-parametria` copy keeps resolving unchanged.
# A placeholder `SKILL.md` under that same name would register into this
# preset's layer, which is NEARER than the deployment's, and shadow the real
# skill outright — a regression, not a seed. This file exists only because Git
# does not track empty directories; the installer creates the directory too.
#
# Do NOT put a `README.md` here: a flat `<name>.md` at a skill root IS a skill
# entry, so a readme would be discovered as a skill called "README".
